 'post-purchase'=>['Post-purchase','Verified paid WooCommerce order','P1 payment +2h; P2 dispatch +1d; P3 delivery +7d; P4 delivery +21d','Missing events wait, never guessed. Refund/dispute/support holds. Newer order exits. Re-entry ≥1 day.'],
 'repeat'=>['Repeat engagement','Purchaser; meaningful engagement within 90 days','Last order +30d / +60d / +90d','New order or inactivity exits; support issue holds. Re-entry ≥90 days.'],
