 echo '<div class="wrap"><h1>Puratek Flow Rules</h1><p><strong>Seven primary flows · 21 templates · Import stays inactive</strong></p><div class="notice notice-warning inline"><p>Local verification profile only. Production execution is locked. Provider events, real customer consent, links, email delivery and campaign approvals need staging validation.</p></div>';
