 echo '<h2>Event connections</h2><p>Account registration and WooCommerce payment-complete hooks are connected for marked synthetic local accounts. Cart abandonment/restore, dispatch, delivery, meaningful engagement, support/dispute and editorial approval enter through the explicit local PHP adapter. They are not connected to production providers. Optional W4/C4, W2 alternative and dependency-gated opportunities are not automatically activated.</p><p>Local test fields: <code>_pfi_marketing_consent</code>, <code>_pfi_country</code>, <code>_pfi_test_fixture</code>. See the supplied handoff for the exact event contract.</p></div>';
